<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Feb Asian dollar assets up 11 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>Singapore Feb Asian dollar assets up 11 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  Feb 97     Jan 97   Feb 96</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		524.03     519.30   471.77</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    179.80     178.76   171.51</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    290.89     289.86   253.99</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 11 percent year-on-year in February.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
